This PR consists of the following code;
- Setup of sequelize cli.
- Setup of models, migrations, and other related sequelize configurations.

```
// Edges of the User.
func (User) Edges() []ent.Edge {
    return []ent.Edge{
        edge.To("groups", Group.Type).
            // wile generate a new table "groups"
            StorageKey(
                edge.Table("groups"),
                edge.Columns("user_id", "group_id"),
                edge.Symbols("groups_id1", "groups_id2")
            ),
    }
}
```
in Edges method, StorageKey only support generate `to` and `form` key column,but in fact, the association table has to need more colunms In some cases.

if I defined a more complex schema for the association table  and the table name must as same as StorageKey's, run `generate`, `migrate/shcema.go` has  error because there two XXXXXTable and XXXXColumns with the same name

 so reuse complex mode defined in schema would be better.

1. primary key allow defined in schema.
2. foreign keys force to reset.

New functions:
* Possibility to watch all users by clicking on people button in friends form;
* Pal up button for users who are not friends;
* Remove button in all users page for friends;
* Remove/Pal up button in main form (under user image, only for other users);

